# Keep the image build context lean. The Go images need the whole repo (backend,
# backend/tools, cli/craft, extensions/*, go.work, the composition/ stub) so the
# gen-composition step can materialize build/composition/ — do NOT exclude those.
# The web image needs frontend/ + backend/api/*.yaml. Only regenerable machine
# debris is excluded here.
.git
**/node_modules
.pnpm-store
scratchpad
frontend/dist
frontend/test-results
frontend/playwright-report
frontend/storybook-static
# build/composition/ is regenerated inside the image; a stale local copy must
# never ride in.
build/composition
.tmp
*.log
# Local/instance runtime configuration never belongs in the build context. The
# Go builder does `COPY . .`, so any secret-bearing local file would otherwise
# ride into the builder layer + build cache. The generic images bake NO instance
# config (it is provided at runtime), so none of these are ever needed here.
.env
.env.*
# The gitignored local instance configs (may carry real BYOK keys / the admin
# password) — mirror .gitignore's config/ entries.
config/margince.yaml
config/ai-routing.yaml
config/margince-admin-password
